{% comment %}
  Loads the GentleYou stylesheets on every page.

  The gy-* sections link gy-premium.css themselves, which covers the
  homepage, but the product-card rules in it (hover crossfade, two-line
  title alignment) are needed anywhere a card renders — collection pages,
  search, related products. gy-chrome.css styles the announcement bar and
  header, which appear on every page. Rendered once from layout/theme.liquid.

  gy-premium.css must come first: it declares the --gy-* tokens that
  gy-chrome.css uses.
{% endcomment %}
